:"D000618","fullName":"Sen. Daines, Steve [R-MT]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-07","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"MT"},{"bioguideId":"M001190","fullName":"Sen. Mullin, Markwayne [R-OK]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-08","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"OK"},{"bioguideId":"P000603","fullName":"Sen. Paul, Rand [R-KY]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-12","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"KY"},{"bioguideId":"R000605","fullName":"Sen. Rounds, Mike [R-SD]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-15","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"SD"},{"bioguideId":"B001319","fullName":"Sen. Britt, Katie Boyd [R-AL]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-27","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"AL"},{"bioguideId":"H000601","fullName":"Sen. Hagerty, Bill [R-TN]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-27","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"TN"},{"bioguideId":"M001243","fullName":"Sen. McCormick, David [R-PA]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-27","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"PA"},{"bioguideId":"F000463","fullName":"Sen. Fischer, Deb [R-NE]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-27","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NE"},{"bioguideId":"Y000064","fullName":"Sen. Young, Todd [R-IN]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-27","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"IN"},{"bioguideId":"B001261","fullName":"Sen. Barrasso, John [R-WY]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-27","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"WY"},{"bioguideId":"R000618","fullName":"Sen. Ricketts, Pete [R-NE]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-28","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NE"},{"bioguideId":"M000934","fullName":"Sen. Moran, Jerry [R-KS]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-28","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"KS"},{"bioguideId":"C001114","fullName":"Sen. Curtis, John R. [R-UT]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-28","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"UT"},{"bioguideId":"C001047","fullName":"Sen. Capito, Shelley Moore [R-WV]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-28","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"WV"},{"bioguideId":"B001236","fullName":"Sen. Boozman, John [R-AR]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-28","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"AR"},{"bioguideId":"W000437","fullName":"Sen. Wicker, Roger F. [R-MS]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-29","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"MS"},{"bioguideId":"G000386","fullName":"Sen. Grassley, Chuck [R-IA]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-29","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"IA"},{"bioguideId":"T000250","fullName":"Sen. Thune, John [R-SD]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-02-12","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"SD"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-17T05:12:32+00:00","id":"s128-119","introducedDate":"2025-01-16","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-01-16","text":"Read twice and referred to the Committee on Rules and Administration."},"laws":[],"number":"128","originChamber":"Senate","policyArea":"Government Operations and Politics","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"L000577","district":null,"fullName":"Sen. Lee, Mike [R-UT]","party":"R","state":"UT"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-01-16","actionDesc":"Introduced in Senate","text":"<p><strong>Safeguard American Voter Eligibility Act or the SAVE Act</strong></p><p>This bill requires individuals to provide documentary proof of U.S. citizenship when registering to vote in federal elections.</p><p>Specifically, the bill prohibits states from accepting and processing an application to register to vote in a federal election unless the applicant presents documentary proof of U.S. citizenship.&nbsp;The bill specifies what documents are considered acceptable proof of U.S. citizenship, such as&nbsp;identification that complies with the REAL ID Act of 2005 that indicates U.S. citizenship.</p><p>Further, the bill (1) prohibits states from registering an individual to vote in a federal election unless, at the time the individual applies to register to vote, the individual provides documentary proof of U.S. citizenship; and (2) requires states to establish an alternative process under which an applicant may submit other evidence to demonstrate U.S. citizenship.</p><p>Each state must take affirmative steps on an ongoing basis to ensure that only U.S. citizens are registered to vote, which shall include establishing a program to identify individuals who are not U.S. citizens using information supplied by certain sources.</p><p>Additionally, states must remove noncitizens from their official lists of eligible voters.</p><p>The bill allows for a private right of action against an election official who registers an applicant to vote in a federal election who fails to present documentary proof of U.S. citizenship.</p><p>The bill establishes criminal penalties for certain offenses, including registering an applicant to vote in a federal election who fails to present documentary proof of U.S. citizenship.</p>","updateDate":"2025-03-07T14:43:47Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"SAVE Act","type":"s","updateDate":"2026-08-10T14:13:09Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-08-10T14:13:09Z"}
